OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1788286801
OL,3,CFormer Liverpool player Jamie
OL,4,CCarragher faces bankruptcy over unpaid
OL,5,Ctax bill
OL,7,FFormer Liverpool FC defender Jamie
OL,8,FCarragher could face bankruptcy after
OL,9,FHM Revenue and Customs (HMRC) issued a
OL,10,Fbankruptcy petition against him.
OL,12,FCourt records show HMRC issued the
OL,13,Fpetition against Carragher on 26
OL,14,FAugust over an unpaid tax bill.
OL,16,FNo further details of the case are
OL,17,Fcurrently available.
