OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1788286801
OL,3,CFormer Liverpool player Jamie
OL,4,CCarragher faces bankruptcy over unpaid
OL,5,Ctax bill
OL,7,FAn HMRC spokesperson said: "We take a
OL,8,Fsupportive approach to dealing with
OL,9,Fcustomers who have tax debts and do
OL,10,Feverything we can to help those who
OL,11,Fengage with us to get out of debt,
OL,12,Fsuch as offering instalment plans.
OL,14,F"We only petition for bankruptcy as a
OL,15,Flast resort."
OL,17,FThe Insolvency and Companies Court, a
OL,18,Fspecialist court within the High
OL,19,FCourt, deals with bankruptcy petitions.
