OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1788286801
OL,3,CFormer Liverpool player Jamie
OL,4,CCarragher faces bankruptcy over unpaid
OL,5,Ctax bill
OL,7,FCarragher, 48, spent his entire
OL,8,Fprofessional career with Liverpool and
OL,9,Fwas part of the squad which won the
OL,10,FChampions League in 2005.
OL,12,FHe retired in 2013 after making 737
OL,13,Fappearances for the club and has since
OL,14,Fbecome a pundit with Sky Sports and
OL,15,FCBS Sports.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for Carragher told BBC
OL,18,FSport: "This is a private tax matter
OL,19,Fthat should have been resolved sooner,
OL,20,Fand the appropriate steps are being
OL,21,Ftaken today to settle it.
OL,26,@zD@HOU
